window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Sitting on my throne, I reign over the underworld with a fist of iron.</b></p> <p>The darkness runs deep within me as I revel in the violence of depravity, for I am King of all I rule, and this is hell.</p> <p>Times are changing. Enemies old and new are challenging us. If Naturals and Humans want to survive, they must combine their forces. It didn't work before, so why do they think it will this time? Will all be lost?</p> <p>You brought yourself into my line of sight. You willingly walked into my domain.</p> <p>She thought she knew what she was walking into. She has no clue. She is a temptation I can not deny.</p> <p>Don't start to think I have a soul, for I lost that a long time ago. Don't think I'm your savior, for I'm your downfall.</p> <p>He will be my destruction. That doesn't stop me from seeking him out. He will break me and not think twice about doing so.</p> <p>The darkness runs deep within him, deeper and stronger than I realized. I still can't keep away.</p>"; 
